---
import { StatusBadge } from "../components/StatusBadge";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Indie Products Map</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="一个非官方独立产品灵感浏览器的 Astro 项目骨架。"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-5xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16">
      <section class="max-w-2xl">
        <StatusBadge client:load label="Astro + React Islands ready" />
        <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-slate-950">
          Indie Products Map
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
          当前提交只包含项目初始化骨架，后续任务卡会继续补充数据模型、解析脚本和页面功能。
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
